  description="Volynx terms of service for website, tools, digital products, and subscriptions."
>
  <div class="kicker" data-i18n="legal.kicker">Legal</div>
  <h1 data-i18n="terms.title">Terms of Service</h1>
  <p data-i18n-html="terms.intro">These Terms govern your use of Volynx websites, tools, digital products, and services available at <strong>volynx.world</strong>. By using our platform, you agree to these terms.</p>

  <h2 data-i18n="terms.products_title">Products and licenses</h2>
