    <li data-i18n="terms.products_redistribution">Redistribution, resale, repackaging, or sublicensing of Volynx products as standalone assets is prohibited without written permission.</li>
    <li data-i18n="terms.products_icons">Icon packs and design systems may be used in unlimited client projects under a single license.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 data-i18n="terms.tools_title">Web tools (Volynx Lab & Studio)</h2>
