    <li data-i18n="terms.accounts_sharing">Accounts found sharing access or circumventing subscription limits may be suspended without refund.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 data-i18n="terms.payments_title">Payments and refunds</h2>
  <ul>
    <li data-i18n-html="terms.payments_digital"><strong>Digital products</strong> (one-time purchases): due to the nature of digital goods, all sales are final once the product has been accessed or downloaded. If you experience a technical issue, contact us within 7 days.</li>
    <li data-i18n-html="terms.payments_subs"><strong>Subscriptions</strong>: billed monthly or annually via Stripe. You may cancel at any time; access continues until the end of the paid period. No partial refunds for unused time.</li>
    <li data-i18n-html="terms.payments_services"><strong>Services</strong> (Landing Express, Maintenance Plans, agency work): payment and refund terms are defined per engagement and stated in the project proposal or invoice.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 data-i18n="terms.liability_title">Limitation of liability</h2>
